</div>
</section>


<section id="AboutMe" class="AboutMe">
    <div class="container-whoiam">
        <div class="whoiam">
             @* img in circle frame *@
            <img src="~/img/profile.jpg" alt="Profile Picture" class="profile-pic" />
            @* make it bold, playfair regular fonts *@
            <h2>Who I am</h2>
            @* just normal poppins regular *@
            <p>
                I am a final‑year Computer Science student at the University of Technology Sarawak, with hands‑on experience in full‑stack development from my previous internship. 
                Currently, I am into machine learning, where I have developed a gender classification model and a recognition model for Malaysia Sign Language. 
                I also have experience in leadership and am an adaptive individual who thrives in dynamic environments.
            </p>
           
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section  class="whatido-section">
    <div class="container-whatido">
         @* make it bold, playfair regular fonts *@
        <div class="whatido">
            <h2>What I do</h2>
            @* just normal poppins regular *@
            <p>
                I’ve developed digital solutions across full-stack systems, machine learning, data analysis, and accessibility projects. 
                Each experience, from building web platforms and mobile applications to designing AI models and pitching innovation  has strengthened 
                my adaptability, leadership, and ability to deliver technology with both technical depth and social impact.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-whatido">
            <div class="service-card">Mobile Apps</div>
            <div class="service-card">Web Platforms</div>
            <div class="service-card">AI/ML Model</div>
