<section id="Experience"class="working-experience">
    <h2 class="section-title">Working Experience</h2>
    <div class="timeline-wrapper">
        
        <div class="experience-card">
            <div class="dot"></div> <div class="card-content">
                <h3>Full-stack Developer Internship</h3>
                <p class="company">AQWise Sdn Bhd | Selangor</p>
                <p class="duration">Mar 2022 - Aug 2022</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Developed and refined mobile application interfaces using <strong>Flutter</strong> for both Android and iOS platforms.</li>
                    <li>Designed backend integration for user authentication and utilized <strong>Firestore</strong> for database management and real-time data fetching.</li>
                    <li>Researched and implemented <strong>Stripe</strong> for in-app subscriptions, including auto-updates for user roles and saving payment receipts.</li>
                    <li>Managed Firebase databases to streamline data collection and efficiently retrieve app content.</li>
                    <li>Designed and implemented UI/UX code, enhancing the visual appeal and usability of the application.</li>
                    <li>Updated and maintained existing programs to improve functionality, including bug fixes and performance enhancements.</li>
                    <li>Attended client meetings to ensure requirements and expectations were met.</li>
                    <li>Involved in rigorous software testing to identify and report bugs and UI/UX errors.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="experience-card">
            <div class="dot"></div> <div class="card-content">
